# Studio app (`@pakfactory/studio`)

When editing **`apps/studio/`**, follow [`apps/studio/CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md) and repo [`AGENTS.md`](../../../../AGENTS.md) § Sanity content — agent guardrails.

**Quick rules:**

- **Schemas in git only** — use `defineType` / `defineField` / `defineArrayMember`.
- **SEO/Social:** always `lib/seo-fields.ts` (`seoFields` + `socialFields`) — never per-schema `metaTitle` duplicates.
- **ADR-014:** singular type names, titles, and desk labels.
- **Never seed or write documents** — no `seed:*` scripts, no MCP create/patch/publish (humans only).
- **Blocks:** page-builder types in `schemas/blocks/`; register in `schemas/blocks/index.ts`.
- **Env:** `apps/studio/.env.local` (not root); preview URLs → www **3003**, blog **3004**.
- **Local dev:** `pnpm dev:studio` → port **3333**.
